OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub to close citing
OL,4,Afinancial challenges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cook at a community hub cafe has said
OL,7,Fshe feels "punched in the stomach"
OL,8,Fafter learning services will close
OL,9,Ffollowing a decision to place the
OL,10,Forganisation into administration.
OL,12,FThe trustees of Romney Marsh Community
OL,13,FHub, which supports the over 50s, said
OL,14,Fsignificant financial challenges meant
OL,15,Fservices were being brought to an end,
OL,16,Fwith administrators to be appointed
OL,17,Fwithin days.
OL,19,FLisa Green, a cook at the charity's Hub
OL,20,Fon the Beach cafe, said the hub helped
OL,21,Fpeople dealing with bereavement,
OL,22,Farthritis, cancer and other needs.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
