OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub to close citing
OL,4,Afinancial challenges
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent County Council (KCC) said
OL,7,Fdecisions were a matter for the
OL,8,Fcharity's trustees, but it was in
OL,9,Fcontact to understand the impact and
OL,10,Fhelp people access support.
